{
  "description": "The pay request of a Lightning address (SPEC.md §16, The pay request), as the GET of its pay URL answers it (`http`: its status, and its body as a JSON value, `body`, or as sent, `bodyText`, read as SPEC.md §2 and §15 say). `expected`: what the pay request gives, its `callback`, its sendable sats (SPEC.md §16, Sendable sats: `min` and `max`), its `commentAllowed` and the description hash of its invoices (hex SHA-256 of the UTF-8 of `metadata`); or the error.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "breez.tips's pay request",
      "http": {
        "status": 200,
        "body": {
          "tag": "payRequest",
          "callback": "https://breez.tips/lnurlp/shop/invoice",
          "minSendable": 1000,
          "maxSendable": 100000000000,
          "metadata": "[[\"text/identifier\",\"shop@breez.tips\"],[\"text/plain\",\"Pay to Sunrise Bakery\"]]",
          "commentAllowed": 255
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "callback": "https://breez.tips/lnurlp/shop/invoice",
        "sendable": {
          "min": "1",
          "max": "100000000"
        },
        "commentAllowed": 255,
        "descriptionHash": "049e1c5759f817757d6487545b2419f4692739b51821508f8abe536f9d71c277"
      }
    },
    {
